   817	| DO-I-1 | “This paper is a continuation of [4], where the case when (f) has one dicritical component was proved to be impossible. Here we consider the remaining cases” (Introduction, p. 1) | historical scope gate | For the unique-μ=1 slice, bind to the charged audit §3.1 statement of campaign Proposition 4.1: an all-μ=1 profile is impossible with the finite correction set retained. **REPAIRED** for that slice. |
