   822	orders 1, 2, and 3.  The charged audit identifies the order-one author
   823	inference as `SOURCE-GAP; CAMPAIGN-REPAIRED`; Proposition 4.1 eliminates that
   824	all-μ=1 profile.  It does **not** eliminate the surviving unique-μ=2 case.
