   790	       (\det\delta(\widetilde b\widetilde g_2))^2,
   791	\]
   792	
   793	impossible because the two omitted determinants are positive.  **Case 2a:
   794	REPAIRED.**
   795	
   796	For the undisplayed 2b calculation, the left block is k rather than l; replace
   797	the first line of (4.1) by
   798	
   799	\[
   800	l_a^1=2l_a^2=\det L_a,qquad
   801	d_a^1=3d_a^3=\det D_a.
   802	\]
   803	
   804	Lemma 3.12(5) places (\widetilde g_1) on one degree-one left arm.  Select
