   269	only the correction points.  Hence `q` is finite etale.  Since `Y` is
   270	irreducible and `C^2` has no nontrivial connected finite etale cover, its
   271	degree would be one.  The correction jumps of `f*` do not invalidate this
   272	argument; rather, purity shows that such isolated jumps cannot occur without
   273	a ramified boundary divisor in the finite model.
